  "details": "After changing to android build it still thinks the world size is the PC size, even with the changes that used to work before the latest update to Unity 2022.3.22f1 and World SDK 3.6.0.  As a matter of fact, when I originally opened the project it showed the size of a completely different project that I had uploaded earlier in the day.  So it's taking the last upload build size and saying it's \"too big\" for Android even if changes are made, and it's even remembering the size of the last project that was uploaded as well.",
